@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<section class="content-page narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>People come before profiles.</h1>
    <p>TicketZ only uses ticket details to process an event purchase and show its private receipt. Purchase summaries are limited to authorized event staff.</p>
    <p>For a production deployment, configure a privacy contact and a data-retention policy appropriate to your jurisdiction.</p>
</section>
